---An Identity Platform account's information.
---@class gcp.unstable.identitytoolkit_v1.GoogleCloudIdentitytoolkitV1UserInfo
---@field passwordHash? string The account's hashed password. Only accessible by requests bearing a Google OAuth2 credential with proper [permissions](https://cloud.google.com/identity-platform/docs/access-control).
---@field customAuth? boolean Output only. Whether this account has been authenticated using SignInWithCustomToken.
---@field customAttributes? string Custom claims to be added to any ID tokens minted for the account. Should be at most 1,000 characters in length and in valid JSON format.
---@field timeZone? string Output only. The time zone preference of the account. This account attribute is not used by Identity Platform. It is available for informational purposes only.
---@field initialEmail? string The first email address associated with this account. The account's initial email cannot be changed once set and is used to recover access to this account if lost via the RECOVER_EMAIL flow in GetOobCode. Should match the [RFC 822](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc822) addr-spec.
---@field passwordUpdatedAt? number The timestamp, in milliseconds from the epoch of 1970-01-01T00:00:00Z, when the account's password was last updated.
---@field salt? string The account's password salt. Only accessible by requests bearing a Google OAuth2 credential with proper permissions.
---@field lastRefreshAt? string Timestamp when an ID token was last minted for this account.
---@field localId? string Immutable. The unique ID of the account.
---@field displayName? string The display name of the account. This account attribute is not used by Identity Platform. It is available for informational purposes only.
---@field disabled? boolean Whether the account is disabled. Disabled accounts are inaccessible except for requests bearing a Google OAuth2 credential with proper permissions.
---@field phoneNumber? string The account's phone number.
---@field version? number The version of the account's password. Only accessible by requests bearing a Google OAuth2 credential with proper permissions.
---@field photoUrl? string The URL of the account's profile photo. This account attribute is not used by Identity Platform. It is available for informational purposes only.
---@field providerUserInfo? gcp.unstable.identitytoolkit_v1.GoogleCloudIdentitytoolkitV1ProviderUserInfoList Information about the user as provided by various Identity Providers.
---@field createdAt? string The time, in milliseconds from epoch, when the account was created.
---@field lastLoginAt? string The last time, in milliseconds from epoch, this account was logged into.
---@field emailLinkSignin? boolean Output only. Whether the account can authenticate with email link.
---@field validSince? string Oldest timestamp, in seconds since epoch, that an ID token should be considered valid. All ID tokens issued before this time are considered invalid.
---@field dateOfBirth? string Output only. The date of birth set for the account. This account attribute is not used by Identity Platform. It is available for informational purposes only.
---@field rawPassword? string Input only. Plain text password used to update a account's password. This field is only ever used as input in a request. Identity Platform uses cryptographically secure hashing when managing passwords and will never store or transmit a user's password in plain text.
---@field screenName? string Output only. This account's screen name at Twitter or login name at GitHub.
---@field tenantId? string ID of the tenant this account belongs to. Only set if this account belongs to a tenant.
---@field language? string Output only. The language preference of the account. This account attribute is not used by Identity Platform. It is available for informational purposes only.
---@field email? string The account's email address. The length of the email should be less than 256 characters and in the format of `name@domain.tld`. The email should also match the [RFC 822](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc822) addr-spec.
---@field mfaInfo? gcp.unstable.identitytoolkit_v1.GoogleCloudIdentitytoolkitV1MfaEnrollmentList Information on which multi-factor authentication providers are enabled for this account.
---@field emailVerified? boolean Whether the account's email address has been verified.

