---@field samlAppEntityId? string SAML app entity id specified in Google Admin Console for each app. If developers want to redirect to a third-party app rather than a G Suite app, they'll probably they need this. When it's used, we'll return a RelayState. This includes a SAMLRequest, which can be used to trigger a SP-initiated SAML flow to redirect to the real app.
