---@field sortBy? gcp.unstable.identitytoolkit_v1.GoogleCloudIdentitytoolkitV1QueryUserInfoRequestSortByEnum|string The field to use for sorting user accounts. Defaults to `USER_ID`. Note: when `phone_number` is specified in `expression`, the result ignores the sorting. Only valid when `return_user_info` is set to `true`.
